  "name": "Don't Retrain, Remix: Adaptation of Web Agents using Mixture Hypernetworks",
  "notes": "Reviewed the complete retained abstract and selected exact-v1 method, evaluation and analysis sections. Adapter-bank and router training use source demonstrations. Domain scouting accesses target training-task intents and answer-stripped reference procedures; version scouting is task-free. No target-time gradients does not mean no target task information. No independent reproduction or artifact/license verification.",
  "published_at": "2026-10-15",
  "relations": [],
  "review_status": "curated",
  "scope": "core",
  "summary": "WebMix uses a scout-produced interface manual to route mixtures of source-trained LoRA adapters for web agents, adapting to target interfaces without target-time gradient updates.",
